<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uamucivali ua Paulu kuli vaka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uamucivali ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda uamucivali ua Tesalonika vausonekele kuli kanganda Paulu (1:1) Uasonekele ou mukanda hanima ya Tesalonika uakulivanga, kusetekesa ha miaka yakupua makumi atanu naumo (51) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Paulu uakele mu Kolinte omo uasonekele ou mukanda ku cikungulukilo camu Tesalonika, cikungulukilo cije caputukile mu vungezi vuendi vua mu civali vuakutuala Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi (Vilinga 17:1-10) Livulu lia Vilinga lihandeka ngualio, cikungulukilo vacipangelele Vayunda vamo na Vangelengu vavengi. Cikungulukilo camu Tesalonika cahakele mana cikuma ha vintsimbu via mamanusuilo na kuija ca Kilistu ca mucivali, muomu Paulu uasonekele viavingi mu mikanda yendi yoshe ku Tesalonika. Mbazuvuila ya mukanda ua Tesalonika ua mucivali ya kundama ku vintsimbu via mamanusuilo. Paulu naua uananguile hakuluisa vilenda. Muntu uoshe napande kupanga cikuma ha via kulia viendi 3:6-10</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu uaputukile mu mukanda kulitumbula ikeye vavenia na vaje vanakele nakupanga navo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Kaha uatsantselele kuli Njambi ha cikungulukilo mu Tesalonika na kuvalombelela 1:3-12</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mu kapetulu ua mucivali, Paulu ahandeka ha vintsimbu via mamanusuilo.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kaha ahandeka hakuluisa vulenda na seho yakupanga cikuma 3:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulu naua amanesa nakumeneka cikungulukilo 3:16-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Yange Paulu na Siluvanasi na Timateo. Ku vantu vaku cikungulukilo ca mu Tesalonika, vaje vanakundama kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale kuli yeni vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilistu akasompa vantu voshe omo akeja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Vamuanetu tunapande kutsantsela kuli Njambi ntsimbu yoshe muomu yeni. Eci cinapu cacili kuli yetu kulinga ngacije, muomu lutsilielo lueni luli nakukola cikuma na cizango cije muli naco kuli umo na mukuavo cije cili na kulivuezelela cikuma. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Kaha omu mukemuo tulina kulihalesa hali yeni mu vikungulukilo via Njambi. Tulina kulihalesela ha lukakateya lueni na kutsiliela ceni mu mapakeso oshe aua na tuyando otu mulina kuhitamo.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Kaha eci cinapu vukaleho ngeci kusompa ca Njambi cikeco ca vusunga, kaha mukapua va seho mu vumuene vuendi vuje vumulina kuyandela. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Njambi uapua uavusunga, kaha akaneha tuyando kuli vaje valina kumiyandesa. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Kaha akamihuimisa yeni mulina kuyanda, kaha na kuli yetu naua. Akalinga evi omo Muene Yesu akasholoka kuhuma muilu na tungelo vendi va nzili, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />hamo na milengi ya tuhia, nakuzangamesa vaje kuvazivuka Njambi, na vaje kuvekuononoka Muzimbu Uacili ua Muene uetu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Kaha vakayanda mukuva zangamesa ku miaka yoshe, na kuvahangununa ku mesho a Muene naku vumpau vuendi vuakama, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />kaha omo akeja ha litangua lije nakutambula vumpau ku vantu vendi voshe vakulela nakalemeso kuli voshe vaje vanatsiliela. Neni naua mukakala hakati kavo, muomu neni naua munatsiliela lizi lije tuamilekele.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Kaha omu mukemuo tukamilombelela ntsimbu yoshe. Tulina kulomba kuli Njambi yetu linga amipuise vaka seho ku muono uje uamisanene ngeci muyoyemo. Na nzili yendi yoshe ashulise vutumbe vueni vuoshe vuacili nakumanesa vipangi vieni via lutsilielo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Mu ngila eyi vene lizina lia Muene uetu Yesu likatambula vumpau kuli yeni, neni naua kuli ikeye, ha kavumbi ka Njambi yetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Yala uakuhona kuononoka lishiko lioshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Honi kuya ha kuija ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na ha kukunguluka cetu linga tukale hamolika nendi, njimilomba vamuanetu nguange, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />keti mukale na citanga mu vuasi mu visinganieka vieni cipue cishoti ku mutima ngueni Litangua lia Muene linahete. Hamo vasinganieka ngeci tuahandekele eci omo tuambuluile vunanguizi cipue omo tuambuluile lizi, omo tuasonekele evi mu mukanda. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Keti mutave umo amikuise mu ngila yeka naua houe. Muomu litangua lije kulikeja ngoco kuvanga noho kulitengulukila kua mamanusuilo kuneja na uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko nasholoka, uje ivahanguilile kuya ku ngehena. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Kaha ikeye akaluisa viuma vioshe vije vivahandeka nguavo vanjambi na cuma nkala civalemesa, akalihaka helu lia vioshe. Kaha naua akakovela nakutumama mu Njivo ya Njambi nakulitumbula ikeye vavenia nguendi Njambi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Nkuma kumuasa kuvuluka ndi? Njamilekele vioshe evi omo njakele hamo neni. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Vuno honi kucili cuma cimo cilina kuvindika evi viuma ngeci keti vilingiue hano vene, kaha yeni muazivuka ngueni cinapu cuma muka. Nankuma, omo ntsimbu ikapuamo ambahoni akeja. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Vupi vuakukomouesa cikuma vuavushueke vulina kulingiua hano vene, vuno honi vije vilina kulingiua kuvikalingiua kuvanga noho uje muka kuvuvindika vanamuhumisa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ambahoni uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko akasholoka, vuno honi omo Muene Yesu akeja, akamutsiha na muku uakuhuma mu kanua kendi nakumunongesa na vumpau vuendi. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko akeja na nzili ya Satana nakulinga vimueso na vikomoueso viakuliseza seza via makuli, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />kaha akapangesa miyati yoshe yakapenga ya makuli hali vaje vakanonga. Vakevo vakanonga muomu kuvatambuile nakuzanga vusunga ngeci vovoke. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Nankuma, Njambi natumu nzili yakuvasevuisa linga ipange muli vakevo ngeci vatsiliele vije vinapu via makuli, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />kaha linga voshe vaje kuvatsilielele vusunga, vuno honi vanakundama lika ku vupi, vakavahisa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanamihanguila ku kuovoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Tunapande kutsantsela kuli Njambi ntsimbu yoshe hali yeni vamuanetu, yeni vaje vazanga Muene. Muomu Njambi uamihanguile kupua vambangelo ku kuovoka ha nzili ya Cimbembesi nakumipuisa vantu vendi vakulela, mu lutsilielo lueni lua vusunga. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Kaha Njambi uamisanene ngeci mulinge cuma eci ha Muzimbu Uacili ua vije vituambuluile kuli yeni, uamisanene ngeci mukahinge cihela ceni ca vumpau vua Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ambahoni vamuanetu, imaneni ngoo na lukakateya ku vusunga vuje vutuamilongesele mukuambulula cetu na mu mukanda uetu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Honi Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu vavenia na Njambi Tatetu, vaje vatuzangele na ku kavumbi kavo vatuhanene kukolesa cije kucekutenguluka na kusimpa cacili ca kutsiliela, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />vakamisimpise nakumikolesa mukupanga nakuhandeka vije vinapu viacili ntsimbu yoshe.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Tulombeleleniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Mukumanusula vamuanetu, netu naua tulombeleleniko linga lizi lia Muene liye kulutue nakushandoka vuasi vuasi linga valitambule nakalemeso, ngue muje mu mualitambuile hakati keni. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Kaha lombeleni naua linga Njambi atuohiele ku vantu va vupi, muomu keti ngue vantu voshe vanapu vaka kutsiliela ku lizi houe.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Vuno honi Muene uapua uakulongua, kaha akamikolesa na kuminiunga kuli uje muka vupi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Kaha Muene natuhana kusimpa muli yeni, kaha muavusunga vene tunatsiliela nguetu mulina kutualelelaho kulinga vije vituamilekele linga muvilinge.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Kaha honi Muene atuamenene mitima yeni mukuvuisisa cizango ca Njambi na lukakateya luje luanamihana Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo ha vulenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu tulina kumishika, vaka kutsiliela litengeni ku vantu voshe vaje valinakuyoya yoyesi ya vulenda, vaje kuveku kavangeya vilongesa vije vituavahanene. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Yeni vavenia muazivuka muacili ngueni munapande kupanga ngue muje mutuapangele yetu. Kutuakele na vulenda omo tuakele hamo neni. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Kutualile cuma ca muntu umo kuakuhona kufueta. Vuno honi tuatualeleleho kupanga vutsiki na mutania ngeci keti tumituike citeli cimo. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tualingile eci, keti ngue muomu kutuakele na nzili yakuyoyela ha viuma via vukuasi, vuno honi tuacilingile mukumimuesa ngila linga muyikave. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ha ntsimbu ije omo tuakele hamo neni, tuakele nakumileka nguetu, “Uoshe aviana kupanga keti vamutavese kulia.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tunahandeka eci muomu tunevu nguavo hakati keni kuli vamo valinakuyoya yoyesi ya vulenda kaha vivalingevene viahi vuno honi vakundama lika mu vipangi via vakuavo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kaha mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu tulina kushika vantu ava nakuvanangula linga vayoye muacili nakulinga vipangi vije vivasa kuyoyelaho. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Vuno honi yeni vamuanetu, kumuapandele kuhona kulinga muacili. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Kaha hamo kuli yeni umo uje katondo kuononoka lizi lietu lije tuatumu kuli yeni mu mukanda ou. Kaha nga ngoco mutaleni, kaha mushondolokeni linga shuamua imukole. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Keti mu mupangese ngue napu citozi, vuno honi munanguleni lika ngue vaka kutsiliela.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi amamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Kaha Muene vavenia, uje uapua ntsina ya ciyulo cetu, amihane ciyulo ha ntsimbu yoshe na mu vingila vioshe. Muene akale neni muva voshe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Na livoko liange vavenia njasoneka nguange cihindu cakuhuma kuli yange Paulu. Eyi ikeyo ngila ya cimueso ca mikanda yange yoshe, omu mukemuo munjikasoneka.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu kakale neni voshe.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>